{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16943","headline":"玉泉寺与润上人望秋山怀张少尹 · 武元衡","name":"玉泉寺与润上人望秋山怀张少尹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山寒天降霜，烟月共苍苍。\n况此绿岩晚，尚余丹桂芳。\n禅心殊衆乐，人世满秋光。\n莫怪频回首，孤云思帝乡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武元衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16943.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16943","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}